        <h2> Games </h2>

        <p>In my spare time I like to design small games. You can find a list of them on my <a href="https://craiginnes.itch.io/"> Itch.io </a> page. If you're interested in making games, I suggest using <a href="http://www.unity.com">Unity</a>, or <a href="http://www.yoyogames.com/gamemaker">GameMaker </a>, then joining a <a href="http://www.ludumdare.com">Game Jam </a> to get inspired. </p>

